Block\",\"status\":\"ROUTED\",\"subtype\":\"releases\",\"text\":\"The United Arab Emirates' Securities and Commodities Authority (SCA) approved the country's first two spot bitcoin exchange-traded funds on Wednesday, clearing products from two local asset managers to list on the Abu Dhabi Securities Exchange (ADX), according to a notice published by the regulator. The SCA had not listed crypto funds among the products it planned to review this year, so the approval came earlier than market participants expected. The funds will hold bitcoin directly and begin trading on November 24. The issuers said they plan to seed the funds with about 2,200 BTC bought on the spot market before launch. An SCA spokesperson confirmed the approval to The Block.\",\"title\":\"UAE's Securities and Commodities Authority approves first spot bitcoin ETFs for ADX listing; 2,200 BTC seed\",\"url\":\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-10-21-uae-sca-approves-first-spot-bitcoin-etfs-adx-421377\"},\"message\":{\"item_id\":\"ITM-01M5EH88DZ6044Q9RJ5HA5M5PS\",\"kind\":\"NEW_ITEM\"}}", "type": "text"}], "type": "user.message"}, "last_payload": {"item_id": "ITM-01M5EH88DZ6044Q9RJ5HA5M5PS", "kind": "NEW_ITEM"}, "messages": ["0138d9da0ba6af606275dcabe38f8784fee44c309692a1e7bbba74ad4d3b4fb3"], "missing_fields": {}, "model_id": "gpt-6.1-sol", "model_id_basis": "RESOLVED_SESSION_AGENT", "native_execution_receipts": {"sevt_-dCqf2wT4O-y25fFgEmw7": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_2371f9bb661c70a853ba73bf2911a2f92daad31b86b24fcbbb03930cd9b18939_0", "id": "sevt_-dCqf2wT4O-y25fFgEmw7", "processed_at": "2026-10-21T06:17:09.401Z", "stop_reason": {"event_ids": ["call_8165872e5f2a4d6e9a1910e733b51792|fc_0f3f9083af83b219016ad858e4824c8191833620cf8baea1a5"], "type": "requires_action"}, "type": "session.status_idle"}, "sevt_1lw5OAa-S_rye3PGu5Rn_": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_99056dbbf823403708348dde5bdeb97e3f6a83f24e855500260ea1d3bef88bd0_0", "id": "sevt_1lw5OAa-S_rye3PGu5Rn_", "processed_at": "2026-10-21T06:10:58